 end="00:16.842">Remember </span><span begin="00:17.155" end="00:17.338">when </span><span begin="00:17.338" end="00:17.515">we </span><span begin="00:17.515" end="00:17.762">talked </span><span begin="00:17.762" end="00:18.050">so </span><span begin="00:18.050" end="00:18.890">long</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.346" end="00:23.346"><span begin="00:20.346" end="00:20.530">Quiet </span><span begin="00:20.530" end="00:21.050">behind </span><span begin="00:21.050" end="00:21.602">bedroom </span><span begin="00:21.826" end="00:23.346">walls</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.802" end="00:28.274"><span begin="00:23.802" end="00:24.314">The </span><span begin="00:24.314" end="00:24.523">light </span><span begin="00:24.523" end="00:24.803">made </span><span begin="00:24.803" end="00:25.018">your </span><span begin="00:25.018" end="00:25.565">eyes </span><span begin="00:25.565" end="00:25.722">so </span><span begin="00:25.722" end="00:28.274">big</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.749" end="00:34.237"><span begin="00:30.749" end="00:30.941">And </span><span begin="00:30.941" end="00:31.109">I </span><span begin="00:31.109" end="00:31.325">keep </span><span begin="00:31.325" end="00:31.589">my </span><span begin="00:31.821" end="00:32.141">doubts </span><span begin="00:32.365" end="00:32.485">in </span><span begin="00:32.485" end="00:32.669">the </span><span begin="00:32.837" end="00:33.021">back </span><span begin="00:33.158" end="00:33.277">of </span><span begin="00:33.277" end="00:33.477">my </span><span begin="00:33.677" end="00:34.237">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.357" end="00:37.437"><span begin="00:34.357" end="00:34.549">And </span><span begin="00:34.549" end="00:34.733">I </span><span begin="00:34.733" end="00:35.109">still </span><span begin="00:35.109" end="00:35.382">love </span><span begin="00:35.597" end="00:35.837">you </span><span begin="00:36.037" end="00:36.181">in </span><span begin="00:36.181" end="00:36.350">the </